# Collapse to exactly one row per Country_ISO x Year before the join below.
# The manual file (or, if it ever works again, the FAOSTAT package path) can
# contain multiple rows per country-year (e.g. several Item variants that
# all match the "Cropland" name filter, such as "Cropland" and "Cropland,
